  <p>
  <center>
 
  <p></p>
 
  </center>
  <p>
  <strong><font size="5" color="#FF0000" face="Arial">JOIN PWO AND/OR ADD NEW 
  SITES</font></strong></p>
  <p align="left">

<font face="Arial" size="3" color="#800000">This is a Philatelic <i>Webmasters</i> 
Organization,&nbsp; an organization thought for webmasters who create philatelic sites.&nbsp;We expect that 
only those webmasters join, who can propose sites showing some philatelic 
contents of interest. Please <span style="background-color: #FFFF00">abstain</span> 
if your pages are purely commercial, trade, just collection of links, etc., i.e. 
where a stamp collectors cannot learn/admire/love something. </font>
  </p>

  <p align="left">

<font face="Arial" size="3" color="#800000">We don't expect that you are an 
expert in your philatelic field or that you have a degree in computing, that's 
why any stamps fan who wishes to show or to say something about 
stamps, and who presents a philatelic site (but not his quickly and dirty made 
2-3 pages!) is kindly invited. </font>
  </p>

  <p align="left">

<font face="Arial" size="3" color="#800000">Please enter below information referring to sites names and
URLs and </font><font face="Arial" size="3" color="#FF0000">not</font><font face="Arial" size="3" color="#800000">
to individual pages (even if the pages treat different subjects)!!! Your name should
appear several times on the list </font><font face="Arial" size="3" color="#FF0000">only</font><font face="Arial" size="3" color="#800000">
if you, as a webmaster, have created and/or maintain several </font><font face="Arial" size="3" color="#FF0000">different</font><font face="Arial" size="3" color="#800000">
philatelic </font>
<font face="Arial" size="3" color="#FF0000">
 sites</font><font face="Arial" size="3" color="#800000">.</font>
  </p>

  <p align="left">

<font face="Arial" size="3" color="#800000">Please note that your e-mail address
will appear <span style="background-color: #FFFF00">only</span> in the Members
Area and therefore will be accessible  to PWO members <b>only</b>.</font>
  </p>

<p align="left"><font face="Arial" color="#800000">Please use the below form to join the
Philatelic Webmasters Organization online. Read the <a href="../statutes.htm"><i>Statutes</i></a>
before applying for PWO membership and apply only if you agree with them.&nbsp;If you were accepted, 
you can ask for your username and password,
<a href="mailto:president%20AT%20pwmo.org">by e-mail</a><font color="#800000"> 
(replace the At by @).</font> You can consider your 
candidature as accepted if your record stays a longer time on the members list. 
Anyway, please provide a link from the <span style="background-color: #FFFF00">first</span> page of your site to the PWO, by using 
the image shown below, in order to make our organization known to other 
collectors and webmasters:</font></p>

<p><a href="http://www.pwmo.org"><img border="0" src="../images/pwo-logo.gif"></a><font 
face="Arial" color="#800000">&nbsp;</font></p>

<p align="left"><font face="Arial" color="#800000">Contact us if you cannot put 
the image on your front page. Please link it to
<a href="http://www.pwmo.org">http://www.pwmo.org</a> (mandatory). It is the 
(small) price that you pay for our effort of promoting the philatelic web 
mastering, that's why after some time we'll be obliged to
<span style="background-color: #FFFF00">remove</span> any site that doesn't link 
to PWO. Let us know by e-mail if the URL of your site or 
your e-mail address changed. We will periodically remove the records that aren't 
up to date!</font></p>

<p align="left"><b><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">Important Hints</font></b></p>

<ul>
  <li>
    <p align="left"><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2"><i>Site Name</i>: please fill
    it in, using the right capitalization, like &quot;Paintings on Stamps&quot;
    and not like &quot;paintings on Stamps&quot;. Give suggestive names, that
    say something about your site (</font><font color="#FF0000" face="Arial" size="2">not</font><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">
    like: John's Stamp Page)</font></li>
  <li>
    <p align="left"><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2"><i>Site Type</i>:
    Please click <a href="categories.htm" target="_blank"><i>here</i></a> for
    more information on different site types.</font></li>
  <li>
    <p align="left"><i><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">Author's Name</font></i><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">: please fill in your
    LAST name in CAPS and then your first name, using the right capitalization
    and a <i>comma</i>, like &quot;MANTA</font><font color="#FF0000" face="Arial" size="2"><b>,</b> </font><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">
    Victor&quot;, </font><font color="#FF0000" face="Arial" size="2">not</font><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">
    like
    &quot;victor manta&quot;, </font><font color="#FF0000" face="Arial" size="2">not</font><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">
    like VICTOR MANTA and </font><font color="#FF0000" face="Arial" size="2">not</font><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">
    like &quot;MANTA Victor&quot;. !!!</font></li>
  <li>
    <p align="left"><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2"><i>Languages</i>: If possible
    choose languages that many people speak on the Internet, like English, 
    French, etc.&nbsp;</font></li>
  <li>
    <p align="left"><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">After having successfully
    joined PWO, eventually send us an <i>
    <a href="mailto:president%20AT%20pwmo.org">e-mail</a></i>
    and <span style="background-color: #FFFF00">ask</span> for the <span style="background-color: #FFFF00">User
    Name and Password,</span> in order to access the area reserved to PWO 
    members. Please put into the Subject line of your e-mail: &quot;PWO Members Area 
    Password&quot; and write in the body of the e-mail your name and the name of the 
    country where you are living. </font></li>
</ul>

  <p align="center"><strong><font size="4" color="#FF0000" face="Arial">
  NEW PWO MEMBER AND/OR ADD SITE INFORMATION</font></strong></p>

  <p align="left"><strong>
  <font face="Arial" style="font-size: smaller" color="#FF0000">NOTE. Due to 
  frequent SPAMMING of the list, DON'T FILL-IN the fields below, but send me please their 
  contents by <i>
  <a href="mailto:president%20AT%20pwmo.org">e-mail</a></i>. I'll update the listing of members ASAP. Thank 
  you for your 
  understanding.</font></strong></p>

  <center>

